# NOTICE

This repository (`CaicoLeung/skills` — pending rename, see
[issue #64](https://github.com/CaicoLeung/skills/issues/64)) is the **Loop
Driver**, a tool built **on top of** [`mattpocock/skills`](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills)
("Skills for Real Engineers"). It is *not* a fork: there is no selective sync
of upstream's tree (ADR-0001's "fork" framing was withdrawn in
[ADR-0012](docs/adr/0012-reverse-skill-reframe-loop-driver-tool.md)). The Loop
Driver consumes the issues `mattpocock/skills`'s `to-spec` / `to-tickets`
generate and drives them to completion.

